# Security Policy

## Supported Versions

All Luigi Core, Platypus Core, and Phoenix Core applications are provided frequent security checks as of January 1st, 2026.
Luigi Language Test Environment ("Luigi LTE") is regularly monitored for security issues in collaboration with third party entities.
Luigi Test Environment ("Luigi Test") is an offline, internal system to HalvedLabs. It receives standard security checks, though is not provided to the public for general use.

All Luigi applications and their sub-variants older than Version 0.1.0 are no longer checked for security issues as of March 30th, 2026.

| Version              | Supported          |
| -------------------- | ------------------ |
| Luigi Core 0.1.x     | :white_check_mark: |
| Luigi LTE  0.2.x     | :white_check_mark: |
| Luigi Test  0.1.x    | :white_check_mark: |
| Phoenix Core 0.1.x   | :white_check_mark: |
| All Luigi Bots < 0.1 | :x:                |

## Reporting a Vulnerability

Vulnerabilities discovered in the above applications may be reported to HalvedLabs at halvedlabs@pm.me, and may also be communicated to the primary developer directly at ctrlaltspire@halvyx.net.

Once a vulnerability is reported, it will be followed up on by a HalvedLabs staff member within 24-72 hours where possible. Vulnerability reports will have a guaranteed response within 5 business days. Updates will be provided once HalvedLabs staff begin investigating the issue, and a final changelog will be published upon resolution no later than 30 calendar days from the original report date.

If a vulnerability report is accepted, a HalvedLabs staff member may follow up via e-mail from halvedlabs@pm.me. Please ensure this e-mail address is whitelisted in your preferred e-mail application to avoid being lost in a spam or junk folder.

If a vulnerability report is denied, fear not! Denied vulnerability reports may still be examined within 30-90 calendar days of the original report date. Please be aware that HalvedLabs is a volunteer-run collective, and we may not be able to reach everything.
